  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Brottsplatsutr, Serbien</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CrimeSceneInvestig, Serb</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka den nationella kapaciteten f&#xf6;r brottsplatsutredning i Serbien. Svenska Rikspolisstyrelsen &#xe4;r genomf&#xf6;rande part och projektet kommer att finansieras av Sida under en period av tre &#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project objective is improved crime scene investigations with the purpose to make available all possible technical evidence and correct investigation of crime as part of the overall effort to enhance fight against crime in Serbia. The Swedish National Police Board is the implementing partner. The project will be supported for a period of three years.</narrative>
  </description>
